  "duration": 60.469,
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "hook",
      "text": "Unpopular opinion: sometimes, the fake is the smarter buy.",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 3.973
    },
    {
      "key": "price",
      "text": "Most of a luxury price isn't the product. It's the logo, the ads, and the fancy store.",
      "start": 4.523,
      "end": 9.543
    },
    {
      "key": "copy",
      "text": "Take that away, and a good copy can look almost identical, for a fraction of the cost.",
      "start": 10.043,
      "end": 14.992
    },
    {
      "key": "same",
      "text": "Same shape. Same colour. Same everyday use.",
      "start": 15.542,
      "end": 18.298
    },
    {
      "key": "notice",
      "text": "And honestly, most people won't notice. Walk past a hundred strangers, and nobody is checking the stitching.",
      "start": 18.848,
      "end": 24.918
    },
    {
      "key": "trend",
      "text": "Trends also change fast. Why spend a month's rent on something you'll stop wearing next season?",
      "start": 25.468,
      "end": 30.648
    },
    {
      "key": "worry",
      "text": "A cheaper bag also takes the pressure off. Scuff it, spill on it, leave it on the bus. It's not a disaster.",
      "start": 31.198,
      "end": 37.47
    },
    {
      "key": "save",
      "text": "The money you save could buy five styles, instead of one.",
      "start": 38.02,
      "end": 40.876
    },
    {
      "key": "grow",
      "text": "Or skip the extra bags, and put that money somewhere it can actually grow.",
      "start": 41.326,
      "end": 45.16
    },
    {
      "key": "addup",
      "text": "Even small savings add up over time.",
      "start": 45.71,
      "end": 47.876
    },
    {
      "key": "status",
      "text": "Because real status isn't a logo on your arm. It's knowing you didn't overpay for one.",
      "start": 48.425,
      "end": 53.083
    },
    {
      "key": "end",
      "text": "So before you pay for the name, ask yourself: are you buying the product, or the label?",
      "start": 53.683,
      "end": 58.069
    }
  ],
